WEBVTT

00:20.200 --> 00:23.300
Huh
Love yours

00:25.950 --> 00:29.050
Huh, love yours

00:31.650 --> 00:34.500
No such thing

00:34.670 --> 00:37.460
No such thing as a life
that's better than yours

00:37.562 --> 00:40.354
No such thing as a life
that's better than yours (Love yours)

00:40.454 --> 00:43.246
No such thing as a life
that's better than yours

00:43.346 --> 00:46.137
No such thing, no such thing

00:46.237 --> 00:49.029
Heart beatin' fast,
let a nigga know that he alive

00:49.129 --> 00:50.475
Fake niggas, mad snakes

00:50.575 --> 00:54.812
Snakes in the grass
let a nigga know that he arrived

00:54.912 --> 00:57.704
Don't be sleepin' on your level

00:57.804 --> 01:00.487
'Cause it's beauty in the struggle, nigga
(Beauty, beauty)

01:00.587 --> 01:03.379
Goes for all y'all

01:03.479 --> 01:07.162
It's beauty in the struggle, nigga
(Beauty, beauty)

01:07.262 --> 01:10.054
Let me explain, yeah

01:10.154 --> 01:12.946
It's beauty in the struggle,
ugliness in the success

01:13.046 --> 01:15.837
Hear my words or listen
to my signal of distress

01:15.937 --> 01:18.729
I grew up in the city,
and though sometimes we had less

01:18.829 --> 01:21.621
Compared to some of my niggas
down the block, man, we were blessed

01:21.721 --> 01:24.512
And life can't be no fairytale,
no once upon a time

01:24.612 --> 01:27.404
But I be goddamned
if a nigga don't be tryin'

01:27.504 --> 01:30.296
So tell me, Momma, please,
why you be drinkin' all the time?

01:30.396 --> 01:33.187
Does all the pain he brought you
still linger in your mind?

01:33.287 --> 01:36.079
'Cause pain still lingers on mine

01:36.179 --> 01:38.971
On the road to riches,
listen, this is what you'll find

01:39.071 --> 01:41.862
The good news is, nigga,
you came a long way

01:41.962 --> 01:44.754
The bad news is, nigga, you went the wrong way
Think being broke was better

01:44.854 --> 01:47.646
No such thing as a life
that's better than yours (Ha)

01:47.746 --> 01:50.537
No such thing as a life that's better than yours
(Think being broke was better)

01:50.637 --> 01:53.429
No such thing as a life that's better than yours
(Think being broke was better, yeah)

01:53.529 --> 01:56.321
No such thing, no such thing

01:56.421 --> 01:59.212
For what's money without happiness?

01:59.312 --> 02:02.104
Or hard times without
the people you love?

02:02.204 --> 02:04.996
Though I'm not sure
what's 'bout to happen next

02:05.096 --> 02:07.887
I asked for strength
from the Lord up above

02:07.987 --> 02:10.779
'Cause I been strong so far,
but I can feel my grip loosenin'

02:10.879 --> 02:13.671
Quick, do somethin' before you lose it for good
Get it back and use it for good

02:13.771 --> 02:16.562
And touch the people
how you did like before

02:16.662 --> 02:19.454
I'm tired of livin' with demons
'cause they always invitin' more

02:19.554 --> 02:22.346
Think being broke was better,
now I don't mean that phrase with no disrespect

02:22.446 --> 02:25.237
To all my niggas out there livin' in debt

02:25.337 --> 02:28.129
Cashin' minimal checks,
turn on the TV, see a nigga Rolex

02:28.229 --> 02:31.021
And fantasize about a life with no stress

02:31.121 --> 02:33.912
I mean this shit sincerely,
and as a nigga who was once in your shoes

02:34.012 --> 02:36.804
Livin' with nothin' to lose,
I hope one day you hear me

02:36.904 --> 02:39.696
Always gon' be a bigger house somewhere,
but nigga, feel me

02:39.796 --> 02:42.587
Long as the people in that motherfucker
love you dearly

02:42.687 --> 02:45.479
Always gon' be a whip
that's better than the one you got

02:45.579 --> 02:48.371
Always gon' be some clothes
that's fresher than the ones you rock

02:48.471 --> 02:51.262
Always gon' be a bitch
that's badder out there on the tours

02:51.362 --> 02:54.154
But you ain't never gon' be happy
'til you love yours

02:54.254 --> 02:57.046
No such thing as a life
that's better than yours (Love yours)

02:57.146 --> 02:59.937
No such thing as a life
that's better than yours (Love yours)

03:00.037 --> 03:02.829
No such thing as a life
that's better than yours (Love yours)

03:02.929 --> 03:05.721
No such thing, no such thing

03:05.821 --> 03:08.612
Heart beatin' fast,
let a nigga know that he alive

03:08.712 --> 03:11.504
Fake niggas, mad snakes

03:11.604 --> 03:14.496
Snakes in the grass
let a nigga know that he arrived
